N AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>28`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명으로 유지하려고 한다. 다음 조건을 모두 만족하도록 명단을 변경하는 경우의 수를 구하고 그 과정을 서술하시오.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>[10.00점]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="1" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="66623764" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="734658"><SIZE Height="22396" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="28776" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><CAPTION FullSize="false" Gap="0" LastWidth="0" Side="Left" Width="0"><PARALIST LineWrap="Squeeze" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="5"><CHAR>MAI1AXjNblZ38e/adhH/3y8gyN+ZXZGIpgV6wODyyASPXI9/jVFSAcoKIMUmvjEsQmKpELHdJoaeEhIJ5WafLfKtRV38+xc=</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CAPTION><SHAPECOMMENT>수학비서</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="1133" Left="0" Right="0" Top="1133"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="3" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="282" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="28776"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="6" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(가) 명단에서 제외되는 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="67824079" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="620"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명의 선수는 서로 다른 포지션 소속이어야 하며, 포수는 제외될 수 없다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="6" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(나) 새롭게 추가되는 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="54546547" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="620"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명은 후보 명단에 있는 투수 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="64120931" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="620"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>3`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명, 내야수 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="67747356" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="620"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명 중에서만 선택한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="6" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(다) 명단 변경 후, 최종 명단에 포함된 투수의 인원은 변경 전과 동일하게 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="5265968" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="620"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="1187" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>12`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명이어야 한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(라) 각 선수의 포지션은 변경이 불가하다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="11" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(예) 투수는 포수가 될 수 없다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="6" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(마) 등록 후 각 포지션을 인원수는 기존과 달라도 무관하며, 모든 선수는 오직 하나의 포지션에만 속한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><TABLE BorderFill="1" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="3"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="23473751" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="521639"><SIZE Height="6643" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="29059" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="1131" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3131" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="29059"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P InstId="18257367" ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="2"><CHAR>내신 2026년 울산시 동구 현대청운고 고1 공통 1학기 중간 공통수학1(빠른 정답)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="948" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="29059"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="1"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2564" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="21604"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>2026 &gt; 내신 시험 &gt; 울산광역시 &gt; 동구 &gt; 현대청운고등학교 &gt; 고1 